Deployment

When we run application directly as a pod following limitations 
•	No self-healing – if pod got deleted it will not be automatically recreated
•	No scaling- It will not auto scale or no manual
•	No application upgrades without downtime
•	No Rollback if something bad happens without downtime	
 
Solution
•	Deploy the application as Deployment in all the production environments
•	Deployment will create Replica set which will take care pod Upgrade and Rollback
•	Replica set will create pods parallelly/simultaneously 
•	Benefits – Self healing
•	Scale manually and Auto scale
