Probes
Common interview question
Without prob no deployment running in production
Interval
Wait
Failure threshold
Startup Probe
•	Run only once when the pod start running 

Readiness Probe
•	Readiness probe cannot start before the Startup probe
•	Failure Threshold should be more than Startup prob
•	Check pod at regular interval
•	If pod not responding after wait time, pod will be considered as failure
•	Consecutive failure readiness probe remove pod from service endpoint(Quarantine the pod)
•	Nos request will be going to malfunction probe

Liveness Probe
•	Check pod at regular interval
•	Liveness probe cannot start before the Readiness probe;
•	If it fails, It will restart the container, because the process is running in container
•	Once the container restarts the container will be recreated again taking the reference from the image
•	Liveness prob Failure Threshold should be more than Readiness Prob Failure Threshold

