Config Maps
•	Config maps is non sensitive data
•	Used to change behavior of the application. 
•	Eg: Listen parameter cannot take more than one valued
•	Create a config file and convert it into config map
•	User can use same image, but before running it will use config map
•	Then config file will overwrite the config file from the default image at the runtime
•	Config map is a key value

 
